    "created_at": "2017-09-11T07:34:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-11T07:34:58Z",
    "body": "So basically if it starts with an ASCII case-insensitive match for `text/plain`, then parse it as a MIME type and then drop all parameters before comparison. Otherwise just do an ASCII case-insensitive string match.\r\n\r\n(Note that `text/plain;whatever` and `text/plain` also match. And even just `text` as that expands to `text/plain`, but that's already covered.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
