    "created_at": "2017-09-11T08:29:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-11T08:29:47Z",
    "body": "Would you parse everything as a MIME type then or some such? E.g., in Chrome `text/html; x=y` and `text/html;x=y` are distinct. I'm guessing on iOS they might be identical, but are `font/whatever; x=y` and `font/whatever;x=y`?",
