    "created_at": "2017-10-19T08:12:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-19T08:13:05Z",
    "body": "In iOS, we only treat MIME types that start with `text/plain` the identical. It doesn't do treat any other MIME type as identical with regards with charset, etc... See https://trac.webkit.org/changeset/221063/webkit/trunk/Source/WebCore/platform/ios/PasteboardIOS.mm (the removed code is what's currently in iOS Safari).",
